```
.
├── README.md
├── Makefile
├── .gitignore
├── manifests/         # GatewayClass, Gateway, HTTPRoute, Nginx, Loki datasource
├── helm/              # values для prometheus-stack, loki, promtail, metallb
├── metallb/           # IPAddressPool + L2Advertisement
└── docs/
    └── passport.pdf
```

